{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1786.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"2b6694779577cbbaff2773b919c278f85667a70add85528a722d7573b052963c","ja":"ひなたちゃん、この前の歌織さんとの小松菜対決、\nすごかったね！　どっちのも美味しそうだったよ♪","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1786.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"dfc20a1dc0958e5f0220b6c7fac968d63df3bebcdc39543c77e4147f6198bde0","ja":"ええ。驚くほどの成長ぶりでしたわ。\nふたりの愛情が、たっぷり詰まっていた証ですわね♪","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1786.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"eb4f528272c65c6e5a69ed672d6bb808410c505b05ec6e124545d3bf2e87dae3","ja":"えへへ。すくすく育ってくれるから、\nあたしもお世話するのが、なまら楽しかったよぉ。","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1786.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"23be0236ac7112435a852be12e0c330cfdcc3566a4de01ee669e7dc3b695b536","ja":"いいな～！　私も何か育ててみようかな～。\nカリフラワーとか、人参とか、ミニトマトとか？","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1786.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"cd51151c00e17a350b38248443b494d70cc3c66a02f73acf37be8cb8393bc481","ja":"やる気十分ですわね。けど、\n最初はひとつに絞ったほうがいいのではなくて？","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1786.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"8531ab61d3a611b2ac278a25d8c0bd61fdab523ca14d6c5e055735e3b2351a45","ja":"じゃあ、もこもこしててかわいい\nカリフラワーがいいです！　どうかな、ひなたちゃん？","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1786.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"648d70fae9ec89eae89cfa55bda50456879981d4d9b02ef13eb852de63583bd1","ja":"えっと……カリフラワーは育てるのがちょっこし\n難しくて、大変かもしれないねぇ。人参もそうだべさ。","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1786.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"42b63cf65ac86977d46b85f51048472621c428e3dd9599f45a7e2f64a07bfd9b","ja":"ミニトマトは、\n苗からでよかったら、育てやすいよぉ。","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1786.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"3788250d9e91aeef74fb2aecea6f265be63f66233f00ba4ea32f66a49cd4a121","ja":"そっか～、どれも大変なんだね……うーん。\nせっかくだから、種から育ててみたかったんだけど。","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1786.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"e42b04a54107ee4e9662e5de907904f96cdadd5c377004dec9727499e88d785f","ja":"でしたら、一度、\n挑戦してみるのもいいと思いますわよ。","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1786.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"a26becdba436fd8b554b28987041433153d6b7706e7c26578cfe869431409af1","ja":"わたくしもお力添えしますわ。難しくても、\n協力すれば、なんとかなるかもしれませんもの。","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1786.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"a1751208d0bc846947e5b77bc3805a72ac09ac78e08a3d560b52ea67d9088b67","ja":"うん。あたしも手伝うよ～。\n一緒に野菜を育てるの、なまら楽しいから。","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1786.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"4871a655d80d8ed6871ac203075ebd1fea765cf20a73655f503653c4961c61e6","ja":"わあっ……ありがとうございます！\nじゃあやっぱり、カリフラワーで！","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1786.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"bf88dac991b2aaa3202839ce22cb1ce9cac3e489ed82ae1531bc1abad65eff9e","ja":"カリフラワー、育てよう～♪　\nかわいいフラワー、咲かせよう～♪","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
